From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UebelAndre <github@uebelandre.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:21:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: ship a crate_universe lockfile

Another Bazel module can only depend on starpls if the crate graph is
pinned in a `lockfile`; crate_universe refuses to repin across module
boundaries. `Cargo.Bazel.lock` is generated with
`CARGO_BAZEL_REPIN=1 bazel build //crates/starpls` and must be regenerated
whenever `Cargo.lock` changes.
---
 Cargo.Bazel.lock | 10089 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 MODULE.bazel     |     3 +
 2 files changed, 10092 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Cargo.Bazel.lock

